{"errno":0,"errmsg":"","security":false,"data":{"id":"6413","title":"POCO Introduces POCO X8s, Adding a Compact, Capable All-Rounder to X Pro Series","desc":"POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today introduced POCO X8s, the latest addition to POCO X Pro Series.","view_cnt":"180","like_cnt":"0","add_time":"1792827783","haslike":false,"image_url":["https://i02.appmifile.com/153_operatorx_operatorx_opx/24/10/2026/3eb2c3a6e820af69d718211995baf04f.png"],"video_url":"","ad":{"title":"","link":"","image_url":""},"content":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeijing, CHINA, October 25, 2026 \u003c/strong\u003e— POCO, a leading technology brand among young tech enthusiasts, today introduced POCO X8s, the latest addition to POCO X Pro Series. Designed as a compact all-rounder, POCO X8s combines a flagship display, versatile cameras, a large battery, and responsive performance in a body made for comfortable one-handed use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEffortlessly Light, Brilliantly Vivid\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eMeasuring 8.06mm thick and weighing 187g,¹ POCO X8s brings everyday versatility to a compact design that is easy to hold and carry. A micro-curved aluminum frame and glass back provide a smooth, comfortable feel, while the camera module matches the body color for a clean, unified look. POCO X8s comes in blue, white, and black — the black colorway features a black-silver color design for a distinctive finish.²\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFramed by ultra-thin 1.18mm bezels,¹ the 6.35-inch 1.5K AMOLED display features an M10 display panel with up to 3,500 nits of multi-scenario peak brightness for clear visibility in direct sunlight. Powered by POCO's first 1–120Hz Adaptive refresh rate Pro, the screen dynamically balances smoother visuals and lowers power consumption for longer battery life. Rounding out the display experience are triple TÜV Rheinland eye-care certifications for comfortable long sessions, along with an ultrasonic fingerprint sensor featuring wet-touch support and press-and-slide enrollment for fast, dependable unlocking.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/453_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/24/10/2026/a659721473f390868c2f0342dc0bffaf.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTriple Camera Versatility, Brought Closer\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eAt the heart of POCO X8s's imaging capabilities is a versatile triple camera system designed to cover every distance, from sweeping landscapes to striking portraits. The main camera features a 50MP Light Fusion 800 image sensor with OIS, capturing clear, detailed shots with enhanced stability. For the first time in POCO X Pro Series, the setup includes a 50MP 2.5x telephoto camera, paired with an 8MP ultra-wide camera. Live Moment supports up to 1080p, preserving motion with greater clarity and detail.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/396_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/24/10/2026/352da895e5fb05f3aad78966a25b2fc1.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAn Elevated Everyday Experience, Powered to Last\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eDriven by the Snapdragon® 7 Gen 4 Mobile Platform, POCO X8s delivers responsive performance across app launches, multitasking, and entertainment. POCO 3D IceLoop system keeps thermals in check during intensive tasks, helping sustain that performance over time.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eWithin its compact body, POCO X8s houses a 6,330mAh (typ) battery with 16% silicon content, bringing a large battery capacity to a phone designed for comfortable one-handed use. 100W HyperCharge provides fast charging,³ while 22.5W reverse charging allows users to power compatible devices on the go.⁴\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/97_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/24/10/2026/e7b5a1014eebbca51c2f427f58c41658.jpg\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eFor other everyday experiences, IP68 dust and water resistance rating keeps POCO X8s covered against rain and accidental splashes,⁵ while dual speakers round out the experience with fuller, more immersive audio.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"//i02.appmifile.com/232_operatorx_operatorx_uploadTiptapImage/24/10/2026/257e625b87592b4aadb440040a420e42.jpg\" alt=\"A smartphone is displayed from the side, with the \u0026quot;IP68\u0026quot; lettering and a few water droplets in the background, showcasing its waterproof features.\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Availability\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO X8s will be available in three colors: Black, Blue, and White.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003eIt will be available in two variants: 8GB + 256GB and 12GB + 512GB.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Availability may vary by country/region. You may consult third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e*Available storage and RAM are less than the total memory due to storage of the operating system and software pre-installed on the device.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePrice and availability vary between markets and sales channels. Please refer to \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/global/poco/\"\u003emi.com\u003c/a\u003e for product availability and detailed regional sales information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisclaimers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e¹ Data tested by POCO internal labs. Actual results may vary.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e² Availability may vary by country/region, you may consult third party shopping websites for more purchasing options.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e³ 100W HyperCharge means the adapter output power is 100W. Actual power output may vary depending on the environment. Please consult the local seller on the availability of the power adapter in the box.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁴ Supports up to 22.5W wired reverse charging, compatible with devices verified through POCO labs testing.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e⁵ The device has been tested and certified to be resistant to splash, water, and dust in the presence of specific laboratory conditions with the classification IP68 ingress protection based on IEC 60529:1989+A1:1999+A2:2013 and EN 60529:1991+A1:2000+A2:2013. Please be noted that the test conditions of water resistance include: submersion in static freshwater up to a depth of 2 meters, up to 30 minutes, with a temperature delta between the water and product being 5°C or less. Such water resistance features only pertain to specific conditions tested in a laboratory environment, which do not correspond to the normal conditions of use by consumers. Therefore, ingress protection is not assured if the product is subjected to environments beyond the test conditions. We recommend that you do not test it by yourself. Not advised for beach or pool use. Ingress protection might deteriorate from daily wear and tear, physical damage and/or disassembly needed in case of repair. Avoid charging the product, operating the physical buttons, or removing the SIM tray when product is exposed to moisture. Please carefully refer to user's manual for other safety instructions. The warranty will not cover the liquid damage caused in the environments beyond the IP68 test condition.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout POCO\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003ePOCO is a young independent brand born out of Xiaomi Corporation. As of now, POCO has entered 98 global markets. The POCO philosophy — \"Everything You Need, Nothing You Don't\" — drives the brand to focus its research and development efforts entirely on POCO fans' requirements and feedback. This relentless pursuit of technology that its fans truly need democratizes decision-making, accelerates the company's evolution, and refreshes the smartphone industry.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","product_list":null,"shareCnt":"415","material_type":"newsroom","online_time":"1792983181"},"common":null}